{"sourceUrl":"https://pe.ncepu.edu.cn/tzgg2/111419265a10409a8546e169fc320b6b.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:41.305306+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://pe.ncepu.edu.cn/tzgg2/111419265a10409a8546e169fc320b6b.htm","html":"<div>\n<p><span>动力工程系</span><span>202</span><span>7</span><span>年接收免试推荐研究生实施细则</span></p>\n<p><span>根</span><span>据《</span><span>2027</span><span>年接收推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生办法》要求，结合我系实际情况，制定动力工程系</span><span>2027</span><span>年接收推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生实施细则。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>一、</span></span><strong><span><span>报考条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span> <span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，遵守中华人民共和国宪法和法律。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span></span> <span><span>获得所在学校推荐免试资格的优秀应届本科毕业生。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>“</span><span>08580</span></span><span><span>2</span><span>动力</span></span><span><span>工程</span><span>”专硕</span></span><span><span>学科交叉</span></span><span><span>专项计划详见</span><span>“二、</span></span><span><span>学科交叉</span></span><span><span>专项计划申请报名条件</span><span>”。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span></span> <span><span>诚实守信、学风端正，不存在考试作弊和学术不端行为。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4. </span><span>学习成绩优秀，系统掌握本学科专业领域的基础理论、专业知识和基本技能；具有从事科学研究、专业实践的能力和基础，以及较强的创新意识和潜质。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5.</span></span> <span><span>申请人全国大学英语四级成绩不低于</span><span>425</span><span>分。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>. </span><span>身体健康状况符合规定的体检标准。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>7.</span></span> <span><span>接收专业范围：我系接收能源动力类（能源与动力工程、能源与环境系统工程、储能科学与工程、氢能科学与工程、新能源科学与工程等）相关专业、建筑环境与能源应用工程等相关专业考生。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>原则上不接收跨一级学科申请</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、学科交叉专项计划申请报名条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>为进一步加强学科交叉研究，动力工程系将在</span><span>“</span><span>085802</span><span>动力工程”专业，跨一级学科接收不超过</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>名推免硕士生。该专项计划是</span><span>“卓越工程师”项目的重要组成部分，具体要求如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><span>①</span><span><span>满足</span><span>“一、报考条件”中的</span><span>1-6</span><span>项要求；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>②</span><span><span>学生在所在专业的学分绩位于前</span><span>10%</span><span>，以所在学校出具的有效证明为准；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>③</span><span><span>本科专业限工学门类下的环境工程类（</span><span>0825</span><span>）、机械类（</span><span>0802</span><span>）、自动化类（</span><span>0808</span><span>）相关专业；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>④</span><span><span>申请人须与拟招生的硕士生导师先联系确认同意后再申请。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>三、</span><strong><span><span>报名时间：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>即日起</span></span><span><span>至</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span>1</span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>中午</span><span>12</span></span><span><span>:</span></span><span>00</span><span><span>（以邮件</span></span><span><span>收到</span></span><span><span>时间为准）。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>申请程序：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span></span><span>. <span>申请推荐免试攻读</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年硕士学位研究生者（含本校推免生），即日起将</span></span><strong><span><span>申请材料</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>按顺序扫描</span></span></strong><span><span>，生成一个</span><span>PDF</span><span>文件</span></span><span><span>（文件命名格式：报考专业</span><span>+</span><span>真实姓名</span><span>+</span><span>手机号码</span></span><span><span>+</span></span><strong><span><span>普通计划</span><span>/</span><span>学科交叉专项计划</span></span></strong><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>发到邮箱</span></span><a href=\"mailto:dlzhaona@ncepu.edu.cn%E3%80%82\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>dlzhaona</span></span></span><span><span>@ncepu.edu.cn<span>。</span></span></span></a></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>请报名考生务必在文件名中注明是普通计划或学科交叉专项计划。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>我系将对申请人材料进行全面审查、筛选，择优选拔，根据制定的复试比例，确定复试名单</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>不在规定时间内发送申请材料到邮箱的学生不能参加面试。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><strong><span>电子版</span></strong><strong><span><span>申请材料</span></span></strong><span><span>：</span></span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>（1）有效居民身份证和学生证扫描件；</span></p>\n<p><span>（2）《推荐免试研究生申请表》（见附件1，本人签名需手写）；</span></p>\n<p><span>（3）《政审表》（见附件2，需有单位政审意见的签字盖章扫描件）；</span></p>\n<p><span>（4）加盖学校教务处公章的本科1-6学期成绩单原件扫描件；</span></p>\n<p><span>（5）全国大学英语四级成绩单或六级成绩单扫描件；</span></p>\n<p><span>（6）科研创新证明、学术论文或获奖证书等材料扫描件；</span></p>\n<p><span>（7）本人手写签名的《诚信承诺书》扫描件（见附件3）；</span></p>\n<p><span>（8）学科交叉专项计划考生需提供学校出具的专业学分绩位于前10%的盖章证明。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>参加复试的考生，</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>来校复试时</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>需要提供以上材料</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>原件及复印件，</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>以备资格审查。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>五</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、复试</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>时间</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>方式</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>及</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>复试比例</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>复试方式：线下复试</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>资格审查：</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>20</span><span>日上午</span><span>8:0</span></span><span>0</span><span><span>开始</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>资格审查地点：</span></span><span><span>华北电力大学（保定）一校区</span></span><span><span>教五楼</span><span>1</span></span><span>02</span></p>\n<p><span><span>复试时间：</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>20</span><span>日</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>具体时间及相关安排我系将在推免复试群中公布</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>复试比例：我系各专业复试比例为推免生招生规模的</span><span>150%</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>请欲报名我系免试推荐研究生的各位考生提前安排复试行程。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>欲申请我系免试推荐研究生的考生请在</span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>中午</span><span>12</span></span><span><span>点前扫描下面二维码加入</span><span>2</span></span><span>02</span><span><span>7</span><span>年华电动力系推免研究生复试群。具体复试名单、时间安排、地点及注意事项我系将在群内通知</span></span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pe.ncepu.edu.cn/images/2026-09/18ed40872a844382be6e68df2fe2dd2d.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"WPS图片(2).jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pe.ncepu.edu.cn/images/2026-09/fcfbedcb81ca484382175e2eae0b6eb6.jpeg\"/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span>六</span><span>、其他事项，详见研究生院网站《</span><span>华北电力大学</span><span>(</span><span>保定</span><span>)202</span><span>7</span><span>年接收推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生办法</span><span>》</span></p>\n<p><span>七</span><span>、联系人：</span><span>赵</span><span>老师</span><span> </span></p>\n<p><span>办公地点：河北省保定市莲池区永华北大街</span><span>619</span><span>号华北电力大学一校区教四楼</span><span>217</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>工作电话：</span><span>0312-7522243</span></p>\n<p><span>工作邮箱：</span><span>dlzhaona</span><span>@ncepu.edu.cn</span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span>动力工程系</span></p>\n<p><span>202</span><span>6</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span>4</span><span>日</span></p>\n<p><span><a href=\"https://pe.ncepu.edu.cn/docs/2026-09/282202c530644fd6b21b602e1f2bddaa.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1：华北电力大学（保定）2027年接收推荐免试硕士研究生申请表</a></span></p>\n<p><span><a href=\"https://pe.ncepu.edu.cn/docs/2026-09/4ecf59e65ca749c3aeec1b5aaeb98b3e.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件2：华北电力大学（保定）推免生政审表</a></span></p>\n<p><span><a href=\"https://pe.ncepu.edu.cn/docs/2026-09/bf6667124d44484bb5f70453735c725e.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件3：华北电力大学（保定）2027年接收推荐免试研究生复试考生诚信承诺书</a></span></p>\n</div>","textSha256":"b5fd54507b961fe14dca4808499e8c80ea34588755d8cd15f8f1855af3e95c49","textLength":1669,"sourceSha256":"821c6ef3c6df37e6a51d8db5b6aedb874c3590ffee1a39a36ad8d2214c52499a","selector":"article-like:gp-article1 gp-article gp-f16","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-9e071dc6dd20a18dc7e7","title":"2026年华北电力大学（保定）动力工程系2027年接收免试推荐研究生实施细则","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:41.305306+00:00"}
